   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Three verbs",
     "texto": [
      "**Учиться** is used to say that you study or are trained at an institution: **Я учусь в университете** (I study at university). To talk about what you learn, you can use **учить**: **Я учу русский язык** (I learn/study Russian). It can also mean «to teach» when the object is a person: **учить студентов** (to teach students). **Изучать** means to study or learn a subject or topic systematically: **Я изучаю историю** (I study history).",
      "In these examples, **учить** and **изучать** take the direct object in the accusative, without a preposition. With the sense of studying at an institution, **учиться** usually goes with **в** + prepositional to show where you study."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
